OL,3,GNEWSAMouldy maternity unit 'requires
OL,4,Aimprovement'
OL,5,
OL,6,FInspectors have upgraded the rating for
OL,7,Fa hospital's maternity services but
OL,8,Fasked its bosses to improve its
OL,9,Fsafeguarding and leaky and mouldy
OL,10,Fclinical areas.
OL,12,FThe provision at Musgrove Park Hospital
OL,13,Fin Taunton faced severe criticism after
OL,14,Fbeing rated inadequate by health
OL,15,Finspectors in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
