OL,3,GNEWSAMouldy maternity unit 'requires
OL,4,Aimprovement'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Care Quality Commission's (CQC)
OL,7,Finspection in February found it had
OL,8,Fmade improvements and recognised it had
OL,9,Fdone so amid added pressure from the
OL,10,Ftemporary closure of Yeovil maternity
OL,11,Funit in 2025, but emphasised "important
OL,12,Fsafety concerns remained".
OL,14,FDeirdre Fowler from Somerset NHS
OL,15,FFoundation Trust said the team has done
OL,16,Fa "huge amount of work" and will
OL,17,Fcontinue to improve by acting on the
OL,18,FCQC's findings.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
